\newlabel{fig:forecast_linreg}{{9}{19}{Ridge forecasts with the full covariate set at the four rolling origins. Each upper panel shows the last six months of training data, the realised out-of-sample path, the ensemble mean forecast reconstructed from predicted first differences, and the 90\% and 98\% ensemble bands; the vertical axis is the deposit volume in EUR billions. Each lower panel plots the daily residual (actual minus forecast) in EUR billions across the 100-day horizon. Note the differing vertical scales across origins}{figure.caption.26}{}}
